  {
    "id": "emiko_intro_rumored_hands",
    "actor_id": "doc_emiko",
    "title": "传闻中的手",
    "chapter": 0,
    "location_id": "emiko_office",
    "trigger_mode": "location",
    "background_id": "emiko_office",
    "outfit": "white_coat",
    "minutes": 25,
    "teaser": "御堂医长这一次允许坂口进入办公室。",
    "time_start": 540,
    "time_end": 1019,
    "priority": 200,
    "category": "introduction",
    "gallery": {
      "cg_id": "cg_emiko_intro_rumored_hands",
      "caption": "传闻中的手",
      "path": "",
      "show_on_complete": false
    },
    "conditions": {
      "min_day": 1,
      "min_affection": 0,
      "min_familiarity": 0,
      "required_events": [
        "intro_doc_asuka_director_office"
      ],
      "special_requirements": [
        {
          "type": "player_attribute",
          "attribute": "skill",
          "minimum": 75
        }
      ]
    },
    "start": "opening",
    "nodes": [
      {
        "id": "opening",
        "speaker": "narrator",
        "text": "医术得到进一步磨炼后，坂口再次来到御堂外科医长办公室。\n这一次，门外的护士没有拦他。\n\n办公室整洁得近乎冷淡。桌面上只有手术记录、病例摘要和一杯已经冷掉的咖啡。",
        "expression": "neutral",
        "choices": [
          {
            "id": "sit",
            "label": "在她示意后坐下",
            "next": "assessment",
            "effects": {
              "affection": 0,
              "familiarity": 0
            },
            "flags": []
          }
        ],
        "hide_portrait": true
      },
      {
        "id": "assessment",
        "speaker": "actor",
        "text": "「这是你的履历？」\n\n她没有寒暄，只扫了一眼纸页。\n「履历只能证明一个人在过去没有把自己写得太难看。真正站到手术台边是什么东西，我习惯自己看。」\n\n她的目光越过坂口的脸，停在他的手上。\n「医院里有人说，你的手很稳。」",
        "expression": "serious",
        "choices": [
          {
            "id": "face",
            "label": "反问：第一次见外科医生，不看脸吗？",
            "next": "face_reply",
            "effects": {
              "affection": 0,
              "familiarity": 1
            },
            "flags": [
              "emiko_joked_about_face"
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "resume",
            "label": "回答：还是应该先看履历吧",
            "next": "resume_reply",
            "effects": {
              "affection": 0,
              "familiarity": 0
            },
            "flags": [
              "emiko_defended_resume"
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "table",
            "label": "回答：看他敢不敢上台",
            "next": "table_reply",
            "effects": {
              "affection": 0,
              "familiarity": 0
            },
            "flags": [
              "emiko_spoke_of_restraint"
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "face_reply",
        "speaker": "actor",
        "text": "「长得好看不能止血。」\n她短暂停顿。\n「至少大多数时候不能。」",
        "expression": "smile",
        "choices": [
          {
            "id": "continue_face",
            "label": "听她继续",
            "next": "invitation",
            "effects": {
              "affection": 0,
              "familiarity": 0
            },
            "flags": []
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "resume_reply",
        "speaker": "actor",
        "text": "「我刚才已经说了，我不信那个。」",
        "expression": "serious",
        "choices": [
          {
            "id": "continue_resume",
            "label": "听她继续",
            "next": "invitation",
            "effects": {
              "affection": 0,
              "familiarity": 0
            },
            "flags": []
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "table_reply",
        "speaker": "actor",
        "text": "「敢上台的人太多了。知道自己什么时候不该乱动的人，反而少。」",
        "expression": "serious",
        "choices": [
          {
            "id": "continue_table",
            "label": "听她继续",
            "next": "invitation",
            "effects": {
              "affection": 0,
              "familiarity": 0
            },
            "flags": []
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "invitation",
        "speaker": "actor",
        "text": "「明天下午有一台胆囊手术。我主刀，你做第一助手。」\n\n坂口问这是不是邀请。\n\n「测试。」她重新拿起病例，「明天让我看看，传闻里的那双手，到底值不值得我记住。」",
        "expression": "neutral",
        "choices": [
          {
            "id": "accept_test",
            "label": "接受这场测试",
            "next": "@end",
            "effects": {
              "affection": 0,
              "familiarity": 0
            },
            "flags": [
              "emiko_intro_complete"
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "auto_start": true,
    "target_level": 1,
    "benefit_id": "",
    "auto_follow_up": {
      "event_id": "emiko_lv1_first_operation",
      "day_offset": 3,
      "absolute_clock": 780
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "emiko_lv1_first_operation",
    "actor_id": "doc_emiko",
    "title": "她的手术",
    "chapter": 1,
    "location_id": "or",
    "trigger_mode": "location",
    "background_id": "operating_team_01",
    "outfit": "sterile",
    "minutes": 90,
    "teaser": "御堂已经在手术台边等待第一助手。",
    "time_start": 540,
    "time_end": 1019,
    "priority": 200,
    "category": "bond",
    "gallery": {
      "cg_id": "cg_emiko_lv1_first_operation",
      "caption": "她的手术",
      "path": "",
      "show_on_complete": false
    },
    "conditions": {
      "min_day": 1,
      "min_affection": 0,
      "min_familiarity": 0,
      "required_events": [
        "emiko_intro_rumored_hands"
      ],
      "special_requirements": [],
      "days_after_required_events": 3
    },
    "start": "opening",
    "nodes": [
      {
        "id": "opening",
        "speaker": "narrator",
        "text": "第二天下午，坂口按约定进入手术室。御堂已经戴好手术帽和口罩，穿着无菌手术袍站在台边。\n\n「迟到三十秒。」\n\n清醒的成年女患者低声问自己是否会一直醒着。御堂回答得很直接：「会。」\n患者承认害怕。御堂停了一秒：「害怕就告诉巡回护士。她负责安慰你，我负责把手术做好。」",
        "expression": "focused",
        "choices": [
          {
            "id": "begin",
            "label": "站到第一助手的位置",
            "next": "exposure",
            "effects": {
              "affection": 0,
              "familiarity": 0
            },
            "flags": []
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "exposure",
        "speaker": "actor",
        "text": "「今天你是第一助手。我不需要你证明自己有多聪明。我要你跟上。」\n\n术中发现粘连比预想明显。御堂停下动作，正在重新判断术野。",
        "expression": "focused",
        "choices": [
          {
            "id": "adjust",
            "label": "主动调整暴露角度",
            "next": "adjust_reply",
            "effects": {
              "affection": 0,
              "familiarity": 1
            },
            "flags": [
              "emiko_lv1_adjusted_exposure"
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "wait",
            "label": "等待御堂明确下令",
            "next": "wait_reply",
            "effects": {
              "affection": 0,
              "familiarity": 0
            },
            "flags": [
              "emiko_lv1_waited_order"
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "warn",
            "label": "提醒粘连比影像明显",
            "next": "warn_reply",
            "effects": {
              "affection": 0,
              "familiarity": 0
            },
            "flags": [
              "emiko_lv1_noted_adhesion"
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "adjust_reply",
        "speaker": "actor",
        "text": "「……对，就是那里。」\n她没有表扬，但手里的操作立即继续。",
        "expression": "focused",
        "choices": [
          {
            "id": "to_patient_a",
            "label": "继续配合",
            "next": "patient",
            "effects": {
              "affection": 0,
              "familiarity": 0
            },
            "flags": []
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "wait_reply",
        "speaker": "actor",
        "text": "「牵拉。」\n坂口照做。她没有评价。",
        "expression": "neutral",
        "choices": [
          {
            "id": "to_patient_b",
            "label": "继续配合",
            "next": "patient",
            "effects": {
              "affection": 0,
              "familiarity": 0
            },
            "flags": []
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "warn_reply",
        "speaker": "actor",
        "text": "「我看到了。」她停顿一下，「但你能看到，至少不是坏事。」",
        "expression": "focused",
        "choices": [
          {
            "id": "to_patient_c",
            "label": "继续配合",
            "next": "patient",
            "effects": {
              "affection": 0,
              "familiarity": 0
            },
            "flags": []
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "patient",
        "speaker": "narrator",
        "text": "患者因牵拉感抓紧床单，问还要多久。御堂只回答「还有一段」，随后又补了一句：「别抬头。现在不是你看手术的时候。」\n\n手术进入最稳定的一段。御堂的动作快得惊人，却没有一丝急躁。",
        "expression": "focused",
        "choices": [
          {
            "id": "praise",
            "label": "说：难怪医院里都在传你的手术",
            "next": "praise_reply",
            "effects": {
              "affection": 0,
              "familiarity": 1
            },
            "flags": [
              "emiko_lv1_praised"
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "silent",
            "label": "保持沉默，只跟上她",
            "next": "silent_reply",
            "effects": {
              "affection": 0,
              "familiarity": 0
            },
            "flags": [
              "emiko_lv1_kept_rhythm"
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "rumor",
            "label": "说：看来关于你的传闻也是真的",
            "next": "rumor_reply",
            "effects": {
              "affection": 0,
              "familiarity": 2
            },
            "flags": [
              "emiko_lv1_teased_rumor"
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "praise_reply",
        "speaker": "actor",
        "text": "「手术台上少说没用的话。」\n但她的语气没有刚才那么冷。",
        "expression": "neutral",
        "choices": [
          {
            "id": "finish_a",
            "label": "进入收尾",
            "next": "finish",
            "effects": {
              "affection": 0,
              "familiarity": 0
            },
            "flags": []
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "silent_reply",
        "speaker": "narrator",
        "text": "御堂没有说话。几分钟后，她把一个关键位置交给坂口维持。",
        "expression": "focused",
        "choices": [
          {
            "id": "finish_b",
            "label": "稳稳接住她交来的位置",
            "next": "finish",
            "effects": {
              "affection": 0,
              "familiarity": 0
            },
            "flags": []
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "rumor_reply",
        "speaker": "actor",
        "text": "「哪条？」\n坂口说是技术很好。\n「只有这条？」\n「其他的以后验证。」\n她看了坂口一眼：「先把眼前这台做好。」",
        "expression": "neutral",
        "choices": [
          {
            "id": "finish_c",
            "label": "进入收尾",
            "next": "finish",
            "effects": {
              "affection": 0,
              "familiarity": 0
            },
            "flags": []
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "finish",
        "speaker": "actor",
        "text": "主要操作完成后，御堂把最后一个关键步骤交给坂口。\n「最后这部分，你来。」",
        "expression": "focused",
        "choices": [
          {
            "id": "direct",
            "label": "不说话，直接完成",
            "next": "direct_reply",
            "effects": {
              "affection": 0,
              "familiarity": 0
            },
            "flags": [
              "emiko_lv1_clean_finish"
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "score",
            "label": "问她做完后能打几分",
            "next": "score_reply",
            "effects": {
              "affection": 0,
              "familiarity": 1
            },
            "flags": [
              "emiko_lv1_asked_score"
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "watching",
            "label": "问她是不是看自己的手看上瘾了",
            "next": "watch_reply",
            "effects": {
              "affection": 0,
              "familiarity": 2
            },
            "flags": [
              "emiko_lv1_teased_watching"
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "direct_reply",
        "speaker": "actor",
        "text": "御堂认真看完整个过程。\n「不错。」",
        "expression": "neutral",
        "choices": [
          {
            "id": "post_a",
            "label": "结束手术",
            "next": "postop",
            "effects": {
              "affection": 0,
              "familiarity": 10
            },
            "flags": []
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "score_reply",
        "speaker": "actor",
        "text": "「八十五。」\n坂口嫌她严格。\n「第一次就给满分的人，要么水平太低，要么没有下一次。」",
        "expression": "neutral",
        "choices": [
          {
            "id": "post_b",
            "label": "记下这个分数",
            "next": "postop",
            "effects": {
              "affection": 0,
              "familiarity": 10
            },
            "flags": []
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "watch_reply",
        "speaker": "actor",
        "text": "「我是在看你有没有犯错。」\n她仍然给了八十五分。",
        "expression": "neutral",
        "choices": [
          {
            "id": "post_c",
            "label": "结束手术",
            "next": "postop",
            "effects": {
              "affection": 0,
              "familiarity": 10
            },
            "flags": []
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "postop",
        "speaker": "narrator",
        "text": "手术顺利结束，患者被交接出去。\n\n摘下外层手套后，御堂的动作依旧稳定，眼睛却比术前亮得多。\n坂口说她完全不像刚做完一台手术。\n\n「有些人跑完步会兴奋，有些人喝酒会兴奋。」她的呼吸似乎比平时稍快，「我只是比较喜欢手术而已。」",
        "expression": "warm",
        "choices": [
          {
            "id": "lv1_end",
            "label": "先离开，让她完成记录",
            "next": "@end",
            "effects": {
              "affection": 0,
              "familiarity": 0
            },
            "flags": [
              "emiko_lv1_complete",
              "emiko_postop_excitement_hint"
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "auto_start": true,
    "target_level": 1,
    "benefit_id": "unlock_emiko_surgical_team",
    "locks_saving": true
  },
  {
    "id": "emiko_lv2_follow_my_lead",
