    "location_id": "or",
    "trigger_mode": "location",
    "background_id": "operating_team_02",
    "outfit": "sterile",
    "minutes": 100,
    "teaser": "这一次，排班表上的主刀是坂口，第一助手是御堂。",
    "time_start": 540,
    "time_end": 1019,
    "priority": 180,
    "category": "rank_up",
    "gallery": {
      "cg_id": "cg_emiko_lv2_follow_my_lead",
      "caption": "这一次听你的",
      "path": "",
      "show_on_complete": false
    },
    "conditions": {
      "min_day": 1,
      "min_affection": 0,
      "min_familiarity": 0,
      "required_events": [
        "emiko_lv1_first_operation"
      ],
      "special_requirements": [],
      "days_after_required_events": 3
    },
    "start": "opening",
    "nodes": [
      {
        "id": "opening",
        "speaker": "narrator",
        "text": "至少一周后，一台手术的排班表上写着：主刀，坂口；第一助手，御堂江美子。\n\n坂口确认她没有看错位置。\n「主刀是你。」\n「所以我才确认。」\n「你以为我不会做助手？」\n「会听指令？」\n她戴好手套：「如果指令值得听。」",
        "expression": "focused",
        "choices": [
          {
            "id": "start_lv2",
            "label": "开始手术",
            "next": "anticipation",
            "effects": {
              "affection": 0,
              "familiarity": 0
            },
            "flags": []
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "anticipation",
        "speaker": "narrator",
        "text": "前几个步骤非常顺利。御堂总在下一句指令出口前完成一半准备。稍后，她依照自己的判断提前调整了术野；方向没有错，但节奏与坂口计划的不同。",
        "expression": "focused",
        "choices": [
          {
            "id": "correct",
            "label": "直接纠正：先回来，按我的节奏",
            "next": "correct_reply",
            "effects": {
              "affection": 0,
              "familiarity": 0
            },
            "flags": [
              "emiko_lv2_asserted_leadership"
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "accept",
            "label": "接受她的判断，顺势继续",
            "next": "accept_reply",
            "effects": {
              "affection": 0,
              "familiarity": 0
            },
            "flags": [
              "emiko_lv2_adapted_together"
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "ask",
            "label": "问她为什么这样调整",
            "next": "ask_reply",
            "effects": {
              "affection": 0,
